                        "glosses": [
                            "A port city in the region of Samegrelo-Zemo Svaneti, Georgia, located on the eastern Black Sea coast; built near the site of the ancient Greek colony of Phasis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
