                                "sense_id": "71837a2d-dbdb-3af6-bfb7-3f863e849e6d",
                                "text": "The steamers of the Russian Steam Navigation Company ply between Constantinople and Poti. Travellers change at Batoum into a steamer which performs the service between that port and Poti, and which has a less draught of water to enable it to cross the bar of the river Rion."
                            }
